(*
## Utility and Support Types

### Location and Positioning
ILocation - Source code location with comparison methods
IPosition - Line/character coordinates
IDocumentProjectPosition - Document path and position info

### File System Operations
IPath - Core file path interface
PathConstructor - Factory function for paths
IFileHandler - Complete file system operations
IFileLoader, IFileWriter, IDirectoryHandler - Specialized file operations

### Text and String Processing
IStringBuilder - String construction with line management
StringBuilderFactory - Factory for string builders

### General Utilities
IUtil - Core utility functions for results and locations
IComparable - Interface for comparable objects
IVersion - Version information provider

## Pipeline Component Types

### Core Pipeline Interfaces
IController - Main compilation orchestrator
IIncludeBuilder - Full AST building with includes
IStringWriter - Converts AST to markdown output
IDocWriter - Document compilation and file writing

### Specialized Parsers
DocumentParser - Raw document parsing function
IAstParser - Token to AST conversion
IDoculispParser - AST to Doculisp semantic parsing
IProjectParser - Project-level parsing

### Dependency Injection
IContainer - Main dependency container
ITestableContainer - Container with test replacement capabilities
IManager, IRegistry - Container component interfaces
)